{"study_accession":"PRJNA812864","secondary_study_accession":"SRP362478","title":"Bulk RNA sequencing of Bone Marrow Endothelial Progenitor Cells from Patients with Myelodysplastic Syndromes","description":"Myelodysplastic syndromes(MDS) are a group of heterogeneous disease. Emerging evidence has shown the bone marrow(BM) endothelial progenitor cells(EPCs) are also heterogeneity. To uncover the underlying mechanism of heterogeneous BM EPCs in different types of MDS patients. RNA sequencing(RNA-seq) analyses were performed to analyse BM EPCs at day 7 in culture from lower-risk MDS(N=3), higher-risk MDS(N=3), acute myloid leukemia(AML) patients(N=3) and healthy donors(HDs)(N=3). We analysed the hematopoiesis- and immune-related genes and pathways. Overall design: mRNA profiles of BM EPCs at day 7 in culture from lower-risk MDS(N=3), higher-risk MDS(N=3), AML patients and HDs","pubmed":"35351133","geo_series":"","n_samples":12,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN26431948","study_accession":"PRJNA812864","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"AML3","description":"AML3","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5932275","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-04-07","attributes":[["source_name","BM EPC"],["disease","acute myloid leukemia(AML)"],["tissue","Bone Marrow Endothelial Progenitor Cells"],["iPSs-r","No"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR18220482","experiment_accession":"SRX14366911","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":23795412,"base_count":7138623600,"first_public":"2022-04-07","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM5932275: AML3 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN26431949","study_accession":"PRJNA812864","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"AML2","description":"AML2","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5932274","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-04-07",